<report>
<title>Cox (proportional hazards) regression</title>

<p>@n subjects with @d events<br />
Deviance (likelihood ratio) chi-square = @{x2:roundu}   df = @df   <pval>@{p_dev:pval}</pval></p>
<block name="pred">

<table>
<tr><td>@lab</td><td>b@i  = <warn>@{b:roundu}</warn></td><td>z = @{z:roundu}</td><td><pval>@{p:pval}</pval></td></tr>
</table>
</block>
</report>
